<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">mou ikkai</font></font></font></b></font>

30
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:27,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><b><font size="25"><font face="Nyala"><font color="#fff4f2">one more time</font></font></font></b></font>

31
00:01:34,690 --> 00:01:37,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You shouldn't lower your guard, Sensei.</font>

32
00:01:41,450 --> 00:01:45,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bury you and correct
old mistakes, now!</font>

33
00:01:45,830 --> 00:01:50,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whatever you do now, it's too late...
I've won...</font>

34
00:01:50,750 --> 00:01:52,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village will crumble!</font>

35
00:01:53,340 --> 00:01:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the man who carried on the Leaf Will
of the First and Second Hokage...</font>

36
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:01,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Third Hokage!</font>

37
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:07,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru! Now I will perform an
ace Jutsu that even you don't know!</font>

38
00:02:09,270 --> 00:02:11,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Behold! Sealing Jutsu!</font>

39
00:02:12,570 --> 00:02:18,740
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Forbidden Master Technique!</font>

40
00:02:12,570 --> 00:02:18,740
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">"Reaper Death Seal"</font>

41
00:02:20,700 --> 00:02:22,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Jutsu I don't know...</font>

42
00:02:40,430 --> 00:02:43,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Must hurry...
This darkness is dangerous.</font>

43
00:02:48,230 --> 00:02:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have you show it to me.</font>

44
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:03,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

45
00:03:03,660 --> 00:03:07,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you planning to be killed
slowly by your predecessors?</font>

46
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please perform that Jutsu, quick.</font>

47
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:13,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not yet...?</font>

48
00:04:07,510 --> 00:04:10,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like... I was just in time.</font>

49
00:04:11,350 --> 00:04:14,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?
You're already stumbling...</font>

50
00:04:18,690 --> 00:04:22,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now all that's left...
is to catch them!</font>

51
00:04:31,290 --> 00:04:32,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got you!</font>

52
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:41,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let go!</font>

53
00:04:42,170 --> 00:04:43,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Appear!</font>

54
00:05:23,050 --> 00:05:26,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The darkness has disappeared...
What's this Jutsu?</font>

55
00:05:27,010 --> 00:05:28,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sarutobi!</font>

56
00:05:43,730 --> 00:05:45,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry... Sarutobi...</font>

57
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:51,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We caused you trouble...</font>

58
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please forgive me...</font>

59
00:05:56,370 --> 00:05:57,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First Hokage-sama!</font>

60
00:05:57,790 --> 00:05:59,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Second Hokage-sama!</font>

61
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seal!</font>

62
00:06:34,540 --> 00:06:36,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your own subordinates...!</font>

63
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All members in
the Leaf Village are a part of me.</font>

64
00:06:52,050 --> 00:06:55,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The villagers believe in me,
and I believe in everyone.</font>

65
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what the Hokage is.</font>

66
00:06:59,140 --> 00:07:04,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Saru... Protect those who love
the village and believe in you.</font>

67
00:07:05,320 --> 00:07:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And bring them up as individuals
to whom you can leave the next era.</font>

68
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:13,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As of tomorrow, you are the...</font>

69
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:16,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hokage!</font>

70
00:07:22,380 --> 00:07:26,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Toying with even the lives
of your own subordinates...!</font>

71
00:07:27,170 --> 00:07:30,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Subordinates' lives?
Stop the endless nonsense!</font>

72
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:36,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't these kids believed in you?</font>

73
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:43,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come! Enma!</font>

74
00:07:57,830 --> 00:07:58,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're mine!</font>

75
00:07:59,620 --> 00:08:00,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Striking Shadow Snake!</font>

76
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! You little...!</font>

77
00:08:07,550 --> 00:08:08,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over!</font>

78
00:08:22,390 --> 00:08:24,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this sensation...?</font>

79
00:08:24,900 --> 00:08:26,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad...</font>

80
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:40,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Die!
— Die!</font>

81
00:09:01,720 --> 00:09:03,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to hold them off here somehow.</font>

82
00:09:04,350 --> 00:09:05,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Isn't our back-up here yet?!</font>

83
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is out of our hands!</font>

84
00:09:16,860 --> 00:09:21,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Summoning!
Mayhem Technique!</font>

85
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:32,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This Jutsu...</font>

86
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Long time no see, Ibiki.</font>

87
00:09:40,350 --> 00:09:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, is that body
the only thing that grew?!</font>

88
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:45,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stand to look!</font>

89
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya-sama...</font>

90
00:09:47,900 --> 00:09:50,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya...! One of the Sannin,
the three legendary Shinobi?!</font>

91
00:09:50,650 --> 00:09:56,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fellas, open up those little eyes
of yours just this once and observe well.</font>

92
00:10:01,330 --> 00:10:02,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How wonderful!</font>

93
00:10:02,950 --> 00:10:08,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The devil region beyond heaven
of Jiraiya, the fantastic sage Ninja...</font>

94
00:10:10,540 --> 00:10:13,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will rage!</font>

95
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:20,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Snakes that have been antagonized
by the frog. Begone!</font>

96
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:26,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that Orochimaru has finally started, eh?</font>

97
00:10:29,850 --> 00:10:30,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's the Third Hokage?</font>

98
00:10:32,020 --> 00:10:33,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Exam arena.</font>

99
00:10:35,150 --> 00:10:36,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see...</font>

100
00:10:38,280 --> 00:10:40,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't die... old man.</font>

101
00:11:37,880 --> 00:11:40,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... didn't you dodge?</font>

102
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

103
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:49,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Reaper Death Seal...</font>

104
00:11:50,310 --> 00:11:52,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In this Sealing Jutsu,</font>

105
00:11:53,310 --> 00:11:55,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in exchange for the effectiveness
of Jutsu...</font>

106
00:11:56,400 --> 00:12:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one's own soul is handed over
to the Grim Reaper.</font>

107
00:12:00,530 --> 00:12:03,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a Jutsu that costs your life...</font>

108
00:12:07,580 --> 00:12:09,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My Jutsu doesn't activate...</font>

109
00:12:10,120 --> 00:12:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no need to dodge.
I will die, anyway.</font>

110
00:12:16,210 --> 00:12:20,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the same time the Sealing ends,
my soul will also be devoured.</font>

111
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a Jutsu of the hero
who once saved this village.</font>

112
00:12:24,890 --> 00:12:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now, you will also die...
by this Jutsu!</font>

113
00:12:29,310 --> 00:12:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this Jutsu also sealed
that Nine-Tailed Fox, huh?!</font>

114
00:12:36,980 --> 00:12:43,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And now, your soul will be dragged out...
and sealed!</font>

115
00:12:44,990 --> 00:12:47,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body... won't listen to what I say!</font>

116
00:12:52,790 --> 00:12:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll probably be able to see it soon.</font>

117
00:12:55,830 --> 00:13:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your soul is also already
about halfway out, so.</font>

118
00:13:02,210 --> 00:13:06,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who have their souls sealed
by this Jutsu</font>

119
00:13:06,300 --> 00:13:09,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will suffer inside the belly
of the Grim Reaper for eternity</font>

120
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:12,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and will never attain peace...</font>

121
00:13:13,810 --> 00:13:19,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who seal and are sealed
have their souls intertwined,</font>

122
00:13:19,690 --> 00:13:24,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and will hate each other,
and continue to battle for eternity!</font>

123
00:13:32,330 --> 00:13:33,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...?!</font>

124
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:02,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is... the Grim Reaper?!</font>

125
00:14:09,200 --> 00:14:14,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Knock it off! You old bastard!
I won't let you do as you like.</font>

126
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:34,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and... die!</font>

127
00:14:47,490 --> 00:14:49,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, everyone. Line up!</font>

128
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:56,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quiet, everyone!</font>

129
00:14:57,540 --> 00:14:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-chan!</font>

130
00:15:00,540 --> 00:15:03,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Konohamaru-kun, it's not going
to collapse, is it?</font>

131
00:15:03,290 --> 00:15:05,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll... it'll be okay.</font>

132
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:12,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The structure of this face rock path is old,
but is of strong construction.</font>

133
00:15:13,640 --> 00:15:16,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My grandpa said so before.</font>

134
00:15:19,730 --> 00:15:23,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it'll definitely be okay.</font>

135
00:15:30,450 --> 00:15:31,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someone's coming!</font>

136
00:15:32,490 --> 00:15:33,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which one...?</font>

137
00:15:36,030 --> 00:15:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha, huh?</font>

138
00:15:37,910 --> 00:15:39,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then, what about Temari?</font>

139
00:15:52,010 --> 00:15:53,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't run away like that...</font>

140
00:15:55,300 --> 00:15:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine.</font>

141
00:15:59,730 --> 00:16:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be your opponent this time.</font>

142
00:16:03,770 --> 00:16:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

143
00:16:07,610 --> 00:16:08,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari!</font>

144
00:16:09,990 --> 00:16:11,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I assumed you'd been
creamed by him.</font>

145
00:16:12,700 --> 00:16:13,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're okay?!</font>

146
00:16:16,070 --> 00:16:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. Somehow...</font>

147
00:16:19,040 --> 00:16:19,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

148
00:16:22,290 --> 00:16:24,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it didn't turn out to
be much of a delay.</font>

149
00:16:24,540 --> 00:16:28,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's time necessary for
Gaara's recovery.</font>

150
00:16:29,050 --> 00:16:32,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, it'll lead to
his consumption of Chakra.</font>

151
00:16:53,110 --> 00:16:53,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

152
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:55,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shampoo, again?</font>

153
00:16:56,780 --> 00:16:58,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's Sasuke.</font>

154
00:17:01,080 --> 00:17:04,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are several smells near him.
He caught up...</font>

155
00:17:06,460 --> 00:17:07,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At last...</font>

156
00:17:11,800 --> 00:17:12,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke.</font>

157
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:17,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's totally stopped moving.</font>

158
00:17:17,930 --> 00:17:19,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he going to fight with them?!</font>

159
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun...</font>

160
00:17:23,350 --> 00:17:24,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry!</font>

161
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:32,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this clump of countless smells
coming from another direction?</font>

162
00:17:33,320 --> 00:17:37,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! There's something besides us
tracking Sasuke!</font>

163
00:17:37,610 --> 00:17:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

164
00:17:38,950 --> 00:17:40,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An enemy? An ally?!</font>

165
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:43,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know. But...</font>

166
00:17:44,330 --> 00:17:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But?</font>

167
00:17:47,420 --> 00:17:48,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not human.</font>

168
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:49,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

169
00:17:50,040 --> 00:17:50,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

170
00:17:59,220 --> 00:18:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go! Kankuro! I'll take him again...</font>

171
00:18:07,690 --> 00:18:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Temari, you take Gaara
and go on ahead.</font>

172
00:18:10,810 --> 00:18:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

173
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:14,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're at your limit...</font>

174
00:18:15,400 --> 00:18:17,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need a hindrance.</font>

175
00:18:17,820 --> 00:18:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...!</font>

176
00:18:19,070 --> 00:18:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go!</font>

177
00:18:28,290 --> 00:18:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and go!</font>

178
00:18:31,710 --> 00:18:32,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

179
00:18:34,340 --> 00:18:38,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped...
I'll be your opponent!</font>

180
00:18:41,220 --> 00:18:43,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! I don't care who it is!</font>

181
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No!</font>

182
00:18:48,850 --> 00:18:50,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your opponent is me!</font>

183
00:18:55,230 --> 00:18:56,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...!</font>

184
00:18:58,320 --> 00:18:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino?</font>

185
00:18:59,910 --> 00:19:01,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you here?!</font>

186
00:19:04,490 --> 00:19:08,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I put a female beetle on you
before you left the arena.</font>

187
00:19:10,330 --> 00:19:12,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The females have almost no smell...</font>

188
00:19:14,250 --> 00:19:19,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only a male can sniff out
the subtle smell of the female.</font>

189
00:19:19,930 --> 00:19:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though the male itself
has a strong smell...</font>

190
00:19:28,230 --> 00:19:31,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uchiha Sasuke...
You pursue Gaara.</font>

191
00:19:32,150 --> 00:19:36,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because the battle between you
and him hasn't been settled yet.</font>

192
00:19:39,950 --> 00:19:46,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll fight him, because originally
I was his opponent...</font>

193
00:19:46,620 --> 00:19:49,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I withdraw!
Please go ahead with the match.</font>

194
00:19:55,170 --> 00:19:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave this to me here! Go!</font>

195
00:20:00,260 --> 00:20:02,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're very confident.
But are you going to be okay?</font>

196
00:20:04,970 --> 00:20:06,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No need to worry.</font>

197
00:20:06,930 --> 00:20:09,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll go back you up if
I have just ten minutes.</font>

198
00:20:10,890 --> 00:20:13,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph. By then, I'll be done too.</font>

199
00:20:25,320 --> 00:20:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">None of you know anything at all.</font>

200
00:20:29,490 --> 00:20:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys probably don't know
of the real terror of this world.</font>

201
00:20:37,630 --> 00:20:43,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case...
you'll teach me that terror?</font>

202
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:46,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

203
00:20:47,550 --> 00:20:51,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you defeat me and chase Gaara,
you'll be forced to know.</font>

204
00:20:52,230 --> 00:20:54,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is, only if you can defeat me.</font>

205
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

206
00:21:05,260 --> 00:21:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes it's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

207
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

208
00:21:16,050 --> 00:21:27,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

209
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou shizuka na kuuki suikomi hiroki sora ni kao age tobikomi</font></font></font></font>

210
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:42,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, breathe in the air and lift your face to the sky and jump</font></font></font></font>

211
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">toki ni ame ga futtara hito yasumi jaa yukusaki wa kaze fuku mama ni</font></font></font></font>

212
00:21:42,930 --> 00:21:48,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">if it rains, take a break go where the wind takes you</font></font></font></font>

213
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">takusan no matotteru koukai kono kizu o muda ni shicha shounai</font></font></font></font>

214
00:21:48,130 --> 00:21:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">so many regrets don't let this scar be for naught</font></font></font></font>

215
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">ude ni kunshou kizami ikoukai shougai</font></font></font></font>

216
00:21:53,340 --> 00:21:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">let's go carve the in our chest</font></font></font></font>

217
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">sou kokkara ga SHOW TIME</font></font></font></font>

218
00:21:56,970 --> 00:21:58,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">yes, it's show time, life begins now.</font></font></font></font>

219
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">dare datte shippai wa surunda hazukashii koto janai</font></font></font></font>

220
00:21:58,480 --> 00:22:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">everyone makes mistakes It's nothing to be ashamed about</font></font></font></font>

221
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kono kizu o muda ni shinai de waratte arukereba ii</font></font></font></font>

222
00:22:08,950 --> 00:22:19,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">don't let this scar be for naught walk with a smile</font></font></font></font>

223
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">kanashimi mo kaze ni kaete tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

224
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">transform sadness into the wind and continue to forge on</font></font></font></font>

225
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">tsuyoku susunde ikereba ii</font></font></font></font>

226
00:22:29,790 --> 00:22:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="NozakiDialogue"><font size="26"><font color="#73745f">forge on strong</font></font></font></font>

227
00:22:47,010 --> 00:22:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You who are strong...
You who are called Uchiha...</font>

228
00:22:51,220 --> 00:22:54,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You who have friends...
You who have a purpose...</font>

229
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:58,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You who are like me...</font>

230
00:22:59,730 --> 00:23:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">By killing you, I can truly exist!</font>

231
00:23:04,110 --> 00:23:10,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Uchiha, you are my prey!</font>

232
00:23:11,410 --> 00:23:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Astonishment! Gaara's True Identity."</font>

